# The deepest nesting from the item list: item 1, its Service tab, the
# record, its notes in the notes editor (read-only) and its help.  Each
# list on the way is paged to its end and back first (End, Home), so
# that it holds its ring of page cursors; the item list in maker order,
# whose cursors grow its ring to the larger block, and then in ID order
# again (Items > Browse by each).
#@ DEEP
# T_SCRE's SCRE40 runs the same nesting; here it runs in the whole INV,
# which links every screen, with the free memory T_SCR.SH -m sets.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K ALT-I M END HOME ALT-I I ENTER ALT-C S END HOME ENTER PGDN F4 F1
S DEEPHELP
K ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
